00:06:18.510 --> 00:06:21.690
Well, the engineers had to actually plot
triangular orbits.

00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:24.870
It was a very complicated set of maneuvers.

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:28.940
Once in orbit, Rosetta could start work.

00:06:29.960 --> 00:06:34.340
Its first task Figure out how £0.67 formed.

00:06:35.150 --> 00:06:38.240
So how did this comet get this weird shape?

00:06:38.270 --> 00:06:40.370
There's two main ideas.

00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:47.270
One is just that it was eroded somehow in
the center, and so it started off as a more

